msgid "Finite I2S2 slave TX on STM32F407"
msgstr "STM32F407 上的有限 I2S2 从机发送"

msgid "Select `[audio.sound]` to transmit one whole stereo16 frame loan through the standard audio factory and Platform lifecycle. The maintained VE and ZG assemblies use software reference Board packages with explicit chip routes. They establish no fitted codec, PCB wiring or qualified external master. Physical HIL remains `not_executed`."
msgstr "选择 `[audio.sound]`，通过标准 audio factory 和 Platform 生命周期发送一个完整 stereo16 帧 loan。维护中的 VE 和 ZG 装配使用明确芯片路线的软件参考 Board 包，不证明已安装 codec、PCB 接线或外部 master 资格。物理 HIL 仍为 `not_executed`。"

msgid "Select the static audio owner"
msgstr "选择静态 audio owner"

msgid "The [VE input](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/assemblies/sky-i2s2-slave-tx.toml) and [ZG input](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/assemblies/qiming-i2s2-slave-tx.toml) select `I2S2`, `slave-tx`, Philips format, 16-bit samples and 16-bit slots. The standard typed IR claims SPI2's personality, PB12/PB13/PB15, DMA1 Stream4 channel0, DMA1 Stream4 IRQ and SPI2 IRQ. Conflicting SPI, pad, stream or vector owners are rejected before generation."
msgstr "[VE 输入](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/assemblies/sky-i2s2-slave-tx.toml)和 [ZG 输入](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/assemblies/qiming-i2s2-slave-tx.toml)选择 `I2S2`、`slave-tx`、Philips 格式、16-bit samples 与 16-bit slots。标准 typed IR 声明 SPI2 personality、PB12／PB13／PB15、DMA1 Stream4 channel0、DMA1 Stream4 IRQ 和 SPI2 IRQ。冲突的 SPI、引脚、stream 或 vector owner 在生成前被拒绝。"

msgid "Resource"
msgstr "资源"

msgid "Selected behavior"
msgstr "所选行为"

msgid "Pads"
msgstr "引脚"

msgid "PB12 WS input, PB13 CK input, PB15 SD output; AF5"
msgstr "PB12 WS 输入、PB13 CK 输入、PB15 SD 输出；AF5"

msgid "DMA"
msgstr "DMA"

msgid "DMA1 Stream4 channel0, normal direct halfword transfers"
msgstr "DMA1 Stream4 channel0，普通 direct halfword 传输"

msgid "Memory"
msgstr "内存"

msgid "Complete aligned read-permitted SRAM span; CCM is excluded"
msgstr "完整对齐且具备读权限的 SRAM span；排除 CCM"

msgid "Storage"
msgstr "存储"

msgid "One plane, offset zero, nonempty contiguous rows without padding"
msgstr "单 plane，offset 为零，非空连续 rows，无 padding"

msgid "Block"
msgstr "块"

msgid "4..131068 bytes, divisible by four, left then right halfwords"
msgstr "4..131068 字节，长度可被四整除，先左后右 halfword"

msgid "Clocks"
msgstr "时钟"

msgid "External CK/WS; no PLLI2S or MCLK acquired in this slave mode"
msgstr "外部 CK／WS；此 slave 模式不取得 PLLI2S 或 MCLK"

msgid "`nx_frame_layout_audio` can describe successive stereo frames as contiguous rows. The provider verifies that the row extent equals both `layout.bytes` and the complete consumer loan length. Layout describes storage; the static assembly selects wire format. No sample conversion is performed."
msgstr "`nx_frame_layout_audio` 可将连续 stereo frames 描述为连续 rows。provider 校验 row extent 同时等于 `layout.bytes` 和完整消费者 loan 长度。layout 描述存储；静态装配选择线上格式。不执行采样格式转换。"

msgid "Platform startup prepares the selected owner and installs its thin IRQ connections without starting DMA or I2SE. `nx_factory_audio(NX_AUDIO_ID_SOUND)` returns that existing immutable face. There is no caller-created hardware owner or additional initialization authority. The public path is exercised by the [SDK consumer](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/package/verification/io_evolution/consumers/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.c). The broader I2S2/I2S3 format, receive, duplex and master-clock contract is in [the F407 capture/audio implementation notes](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/capture_audio.md)."
msgstr "Platform 启动准备所选 owner 并安装薄 IRQ 连接，不启动 DMA 或 I2SE。`nx_factory_audio(NX_AUDIO_ID_SOUND)` 返回已有不可变接口。没有由调用者另建的硬件 owner 或额外初始化权限。公共路径由 [SDK 消费者](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/package/verification/io_evolution/consumers/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.c)验证。更广的 I2S2／I2S3 格式、接收、duplex 和 master-clock 合同见 [F407 capture/audio 实现说明](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/capture_audio.md)。"

msgid "Coordinate the external master"
msgstr "协调外部 master"

msgid "One privileged unmasked task serializes audio methods and the external-clock handshake. Before submission, Philips WS must be high and CK at the selected idle polarity. The product supplies the codec, sample rate, external master and electrical timing required by DS8626."
msgstr "由一个 privileged 且未屏蔽中断的 task 串行执行 audio 方法和外部时钟握手。提交前，Philips WS 必须为高，CK 必须处于所选空闲极性。产品提供 codec、采样率、外部 master 和 DS8626 要求的电气时序。"

msgid "`submit` accepts a prepared `nx_audio_request_t` with `tx` pointing to one exact `nx_frame_dma_loan_t`; `rx` is null. Rejection retains no request or payload references and makes no hardware changes. Acceptance borrows the complete request, control and payload until acquire-observed `SETTLED`."
msgstr "`submit` 接受已 prepare 的 `nx_audio_request_t`，其 `tx` 指向一个精确 `nx_frame_dma_loan_t`，`rx` 为空。拒绝不保留请求或 payload 引用，也不改变硬件。接受会借用完整 request、control 和 payload，直到 acquire 观测到 `SETTLED`。"

msgid "Keep CK/WS idle while explicitly calling `service`. Slave TX reaches `ACTIVE` only after DMA has prefetched one DR halfword, TXE is low, at least three actual microsecond ticks and three peripheral clocks have passed, and idle CK/WS still holds. Frozen time or a lost channel boundary cannot authorize the master to begin clocking. Start the separately owned master only after observing `ACTIVE`. IRQs latch completion and errors; no worker or scheduler is created."
msgstr "显式调用 `service` 时保持 CK／WS 空闲。仅当 DMA 已预取一个 DR halfword、TXE 为低、经过至少三个真实微秒 tick 和三个外设时钟，且 CK／WS 仍空闲时，slave TX 才进入 `ACTIVE`。冻结时间或丢失通道边界不能授权 master 开始输出时钟。仅在观测到 `ACTIVE` 后启动独立 owner 的 master。IRQ 锁存完成和错误，不创建 worker 或 scheduler。"

msgid "Drain before returning storage"
msgstr "归还存储前排空"

msgid "DMA TC and NDTR zero prove memory transfer progress. Final access additionally requires TX requests off, DMA disabled, a fresh TXE observation followed by a fresh BSY-clear observation, I2SE disabled with readback, both actual IRQ observers withdrawn, and DMA addresses cleared. A later refused address or IRQ withdrawal retains the already established wire proof while preserving the borrow."
msgstr "DMA TC 和 NDTR 为零仅证明内存传输进度。最终访问还要求撤销 TX requests、禁用 DMA、依次取得新的 TXE 和 BSY-clear 观测、禁用 I2SE 并回读、撤回两个真实 IRQ observer，并清空 DMA 地址。随后地址或 IRQ 撤回被拒绝时，保留已成立的 wire proof，同时继续保留借用。"

msgid "Cancellation and an absolute deadline initiate drain. If the external master stops while DR or the shift register contains a word, drain can remain blocked. The request becomes `QUARANTINED`; failed stop never authorizes reuse. A failed DMA-request setup before any I2SE attempt can clean up without inventing a TXE proof. An unconfirmed I2SE enable attempt retains the possible wire duty."
msgstr "取消和绝对 deadline 发起排空。若外部 master 在 DR 或移位寄存器仍有字时停止，排空可持续阻塞。请求进入 `QUARANTINED`；stop 失败不授权复用。在尚未尝试 I2SE 前，DMA-request 设置失败可清理，无须编造 TXE 证明。不能确认 I2SE enable 的尝试仍保留可能的线上责任。"

msgid "Platform close first revokes new admission, then cancels and joins the current request. Refused wire, DMA, IRQ, address or resource withdrawal prevents Platform from ending the System/time domain. The owner preserves shared DMA1 gates, neighboring streams and pads; it never resets the shared DMA controller. A clock/reset/timebase history loss permanently quarantines the old borrow. Restarting the clock does not recreate its completion history."
msgstr "Platform close 先撤销新准入，再取消当前请求并等待其彻底排空（join）。wire、DMA、IRQ、地址或资源撤回被拒绝时，Platform 不得结束 System／时间域。owner 保留共享 DMA1 gate、相邻 streams 和引脚，不复位共享 DMA controller。丢失 clock／reset／timebase 历史会永久隔离旧借用。重新启动时钟不能重建其完成历史。"

msgid "Software evidence and limits"
msgstr "软件证据与限制"

msgid "The maintained host program exercises the real C11 owner at independent MMIO, IRQ, time and memory boundaries, including cancellation, failed stop, late IRQ, geometry, exact loan identity, counter bounds and inaccessible settled controls. ARM fixtures link both exact parts through the public factory and Platform path. These checks establish software behavior and selected linking only. External clock timing, codec operation, electrical limits and concurrent DMA throughput require physical execution."
msgstr "维护中的主机程序在独立 MMIO、IRQ、time 和 memory 边界直接执行真实 C11 owner，覆盖取消、stop 失败、迟到 IRQ、几何、精确 loan 身份、计数范围和已 SETTLED control 不可访问。ARM 夹具通过公共 factory 和 Platform 路径链接两个精确型号。这些检查只建立软件行为与所选链接证据。外部时钟时序、codec 工作、电气界限和并发 DMA 吞吐仍需物理执行。"
